{"id":"n24047-1-8","stage":2,"title":"교외 · 郊外","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24047-1-8-1","ko":"이번 주말에는 뭘 하실 계획이세요?","zh":"这个周末您有什么计划吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"주말에는","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에는","audio":"/audio/0b27d6d47879bf3eaa83.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"하실","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하실","audio":"/audio/d193919346028a46481b.mp3"}},{"text":"계획이세요?","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획이세요","audio":"/audio/0b20910c1b281ac477c9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]}],"audio":"/audio/83d6bc21c9cd2eb06d0d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24047-1-8-2","ko":"가족들과 교외로 나가서 쉬다 오려고 합니다.","zh":"我打算和家人一起去郊区休息。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가족들과","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족들과","audio":"/audio/a3e89ffa2a04e35bba2e.mp3"}},{"text":"교외로","meaning":"郊外","explanation":"교외：郊外；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"교외","audio":"/audio/f76289bd1154229b513a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24047","senseId":"1","lemma":"교외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교외로","audio":"/audio/b55c6b9fe4ccd7801d7b.mp3"}},{"text":"나가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가서","audio":"/audio/585705317584c3255a86.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬다","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}},{"text":"오려고","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오려고","audio":"/audio/b0e08287cc7c98f1edbf.mp3"}},{"text":"합니다.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"합니다","audio":"/audio/ba3bd059cedb445814a5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"f76289bd1154229b","term":"교외","zh":"郊外","audio":"/audio/f76289bd1154229b513a.mp3","entryId":"24047","definition":"城市周边悠闲安静的地区。","pronunciation":["교외","교웨"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8952cd188a15b9973b74.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24047","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2353,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我打算和家人一起去郊区休息。","我们店的销售额最近大幅下降了。","这个周末您有什么计划吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我打算和家人一起去郊区休息。","这个周末您有什么计划吗？","我们店的销售额最近大幅下降了。"],"answer":0}]}
